(205777, 11748, 6025, '<td valign="top">Incredble bacro, but it seems as if your lens has a few shortcomings, or that you have attempted to enlarge it a little too much, or that you have saved it with too hig compression. Especially around the edge of the unused match-head, there seems to be a lot of banding and JPG artifacts. Also, the side of the match is a bit over exposed. Despite of this, I am giving this picture a 9.</td>', 'Incredble bacro, but it seems as if your lens has a few shortcomings, or that you have attempted to enlarge it a little too much, or that you have saved it with too hig compression. Especially around the edge of the unused match-head, there seems to be a lot of banding and JPG artifacts. Also, the side of the match is a bit over exposed. Despite of this, I am giving this picture a 9.', '2003-02-03 07:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
