(206210, 12042, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish there was some way you had gotten rid of the yellow cast hanging like a haze over the photo.  Maybe a darker background would help.  Also crop out the out of focus 3 kernals at the bottom.  Other wise this is a great photo.  Well thought out.  I really like the concept.</td>', 'Wish there was some way you had gotten rid of the yellow cast hanging like a haze over the photo.  Maybe a darker background would help.  Also crop out the out of focus 3 kernals at the bottom.  Other wise this is a great photo.  Well thought out.  I really like the concept.', '2003-02-03 13:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
