(206216, 11841, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would have shown up so much better in natural color.  I really like the reflections in the eyes.  The way it is it is too washed out, especially on the bottom part and the bridge of the nose.  Great idea and concept just needs better execution and color choice.</td>', 'Would have shown up so much better in natural color.  I really like the reflections in the eyes.  The way it is it is too washed out, especially on the bottom part and the bridge of the nose.  Great idea and concept just needs better execution and color choice.', '2003-02-03 13:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
