(206222, 11813, 4648, '<td valign="top">What in the world did you do to achieve these wild colors.  They are so vivid and alive.  In my opinion it''s a little dark, just a little, but it is beautiful.</td>', 'What in the world did you do to achieve these wild colors.  They are so vivid and alive.  In my opinion it''s a little dark, just a little, but it is beautiful.', '2003-02-03 13:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
