(206236, 11756, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of people have ever seen this.  Are they in for a surprise.  The photo is great but need just a little sharper focus over all.  With better focus you''d add from 3 to 4 points to your score.  Great concept.</td>', 'Not a lot of people have ever seen this.  Are they in for a surprise.  The photo is great but need just a little sharper focus over all.  With better focus you''d add from 3 to 4 points to your score.  Great concept.', '2003-02-03 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(206247, 11693, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo.  Where in the world is this.  I love how neat the grounds are kept.  This is an excellent photo.  Great depth which I love.  I love the softer focus for this.  This is an excellent example showing the difference between a snapshot and a photograph.  This is worthy to hang on a wall.  Great job.</td>', 'This is an awesome photo.  Where in the world is this.  I love how neat the grounds are kept.  This is an excellent photo.  Great depth which I love.  I love the softer focus for this.  This is an excellent example showing the difference between a snapshot and a photograph.  This is worthy to hang on a wall.  Great job.', '2003-02-03 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(206256, 11913, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs just a hair more light, so the burnt match shows up a little better.  Other than that, this is a really neat photo.  I especially like the swirl of smoke between the two matches.  Great addition.</td>', 'Needs just a hair more light, so the burnt match shows up a little better.  Other than that, this is a really neat photo.  I especially like the swirl of smoke between the two matches.  Great addition.', '2003-02-03 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(206276, 12006, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love how you didn''t break the yoke.  Wish you had used identical hammers, since it is before and after.  That would have made this photo - the beginning of the hit and the carry through.  But that''s just my personal opinion.  The background should have been smooth also, maybe iron it first.  But it is a great clear well focused photo.  Great composition, just needs better execution in my opinion.</td>', 'Love how you didn''t break the yoke.  Wish you had used identical hammers, since it is before and after.  That would have made this photo - the beginning of the hit and the carry through.  But that''s just my personal opinion.  The background should have been smooth also, maybe iron it first.  But it is a great clear well focused photo.  Great composition, just needs better execution in my opinion.', '2003-02-03 14:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(206287, 11794, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Great capture of destruction of our forests.  Love the sky.  I might have included a little more sky.  Just a personal thing.  The clouds are beautiful.  Nice focus and beautiful vivid colors.  This is a really nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Great capture of destruction of our forests.  Love the sky.  I might have included a little more sky.  Just a personal thing.  The clouds are beautiful.  Nice focus and beautiful vivid colors.  This is a really nice photo.', '2003-02-03 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(206297, 11894, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the B&amp;A here.  Maybe I don''t understand what the wires are.  It''s a nice photo, a little too dark on the bottom, but otherwise nice.  The sky appears ominous which I like how you captured that.  I hope you explain the B &amp; A.</td>', 'I don''t see the B&A here.  Maybe I don''t understand what the wires are.  It''s a nice photo, a little too dark on the bottom, but otherwise nice.  The sky appears ominous which I like how you captured that.  I hope you explain the B & A.', '2003-02-03 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(206306, 11934, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a nice snapshot that needs to be a little lighter, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.  The title tells us why it is before and after, when the photo should show that.  Otherwise we could take any photo and put an appropriate title on it and submit that.  I hope you can understand, and feel you''ve probably heard this a dozen times already.</td>', 'This is a nice snapshot that needs to be a little lighter, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.  The title tells us why it is before and after, when the photo should show that.  Otherwise we could take any photo and put an appropriate title on it and submit that.  I hope you can understand, and feel you''ve probably heard this a dozen times already.', '2003-02-03 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(206314, 11920, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need more focus.</td>', 'Need more focus.', '2003-02-03 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(206328, 11708, 4648, '<td valign="top">You forgot the tomatoes in the before.  Just nit-piciking.  This is nice, simple, but nice.  Good one.</td>', 'You forgot the tomatoes in the before.  Just nit-piciking.  This is nice, simple, but nice.  Good one.', '2003-02-03 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(206336, 12013, 4648, '<td valign="top">gross, crude, and unnecessary.  But then that''s just my opinion, and you expected it from me.  And I didn''t want to disappoint you.</td>', 'gross, crude, and unnecessary.  But then that''s just my opinion, and you expected it from me.  And I didn''t want to disappoint you.', '2003-02-03 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(206346, 11934, 1041, '<td valign="top">LOL, funny snapshot.  to be honest, in my interpretation of the challenge (which is obviously different from yours), it doesn''t fulfil the challenge.  there''s only the inbetween state, not the before and after (or even after and before).  funny capture though.  :)</td>', 'LOL, funny snapshot.  to be honest, in my interpretation of the challenge (which is obviously different from yours), it doesn''t fulfil the challenge.  there''s only the inbetween state, not the before and after (or even after and before).  funny capture though.  :)', '2003-02-03 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(206349, 12012, 4648, '<td valign="top">You forgot one thing, the quarter.  Because they are all mistaken for a quarter so many times.  This is great, clear, well photographed, maybe a tad tight on the crop - should have as much space on the outside as between the two coins.  But that doesn''t hurt it.  Just a thought.  Great photo.</td>', 'You forgot one thing, the quarter.  Because they are all mistaken for a quarter so many times.  This is great, clear, well photographed, maybe a tad tight on the crop - should have as much space on the outside as between the two coins.  But that doesn''t hurt it.  Just a thought.  Great photo.', '2003-02-03 14:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(206352, 11889, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  very nicely done.  i like the composition and the one-sided light works well here.  so does the negative space around you and the skull, both seem to be floating.  b&amp;w is perfect choice and the frame is great, too.  no suggestions for change from me, great shot :)</td>', 'challenge met.  very nicely done.  i like the composition and the one-sided light works well here.  so does the negative space around you and the skull, both seem to be floating.  b&w is perfect choice and the frame is great, too.  no suggestions for change from me, great shot :)', '2003-02-03 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(206362, 11928, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  a very pleasing composition, i can almost smell the fresh coffee beans.  i like the even lighting, the lack of strong shadows and the white background.  centering works well this time, and the black frame does, too, although a really dark brown could''ve been nice there, too.  good entry! :)</td>', 'challenge met.  a very pleasing composition, i can almost smell the fresh coffee beans.  i like the even lighting, the lack of strong shadows and the white background.  centering works well this time, and the black frame does, too, although a really dark brown could''ve been nice there, too.  good entry! :)', '2003-02-03 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(206488, 11805, 6097, '<td valign="top">It took me a few minutes to actually see what this was.  Interesting.  I like it.<br/> <br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'It took me a few minutes to actually see what this was.  Interesting.  I like it. Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(206490, 12043, 6097, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen just a bit more contrast so that the paper in the back would show up just a bit better.  Excellent creative thinking.  It''s nice to see something different.<br/> <br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'I would like to have seen just a bit more contrast so that the paper in the back would show up just a bit better.  Excellent creative thinking.  It''s nice to see something different. Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(206491, 12013, 6097, '<td valign="top">Too Funny!  :-)<br/> <br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'Too Funny!  :-) Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(206494, 11841, 6097, '<td valign="top">I would have likes to have seen just a little bit more difference in the eyes.  Maybe you could have done a fake eye lash or something to have really made it stand out.  Before I read the title I really didn''t notice the difference.  With that being said, I still really enjoyed seeing this photo.  I really like the over saturation of it.  Very Nice!<br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'I would have likes to have seen just a little bit more difference in the eyes.  Maybe you could have done a fake eye lash or something to have really made it stand out.  Before I read the title I really didn''t notice the difference.  With that being said, I still really enjoyed seeing this photo.  I really like the over saturation of it.  Very Nice! Thanks!Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(206496, 11779, 6097, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this shot a bit better if the paper towel had been layed on a darker background to contrast it more.  Not the most interesting shot but I still like it.  Thanks for sharing!<br/> <br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'I think I would have liked this shot a bit better if the paper towel had been layed on a darker background to contrast it more.  Not the most interesting shot but I still like it.  Thanks for sharing! Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(206500, 11737, 6097, '<td valign="top">I like this shot with the two different lighting conditions.  I am however interested in knowing how you got the two different lighting conditions side by side like this.<br/> <br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'I like this shot with the two different lighting conditions.  I am however interested in knowing how you got the two different lighting conditions side by side like this. Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(206503, 11813, 6097, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really beautiful photo but I can''t figure out the before and after concept.  Don''t worry.  I''m not marking anything down because I can''t figure out the before and after concept.  I will vote based on the photo itself.  I am however interested in what the before and after concept is.  Maybe you can explain after the challenge ends.<br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/>Bill Miller (wackybill)</td>', 'I think this is a really beautiful photo but I can''t figure out the before and after concept.  Don''t worry.  I''m not marking anything down because I can''t figure out the before and after concept.  I will vote based on the photo itself.  I am however interested in what the before and after concept is.  Maybe you can explain after the challenge ends. Thanks!Bill Miller (wackybill)', '2003-02-03 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1);
