(206864, 11880, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I think I''d prefer to see the finished plate without the spices ... looks a bit too much.  Still a nice composition.  I like it.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I think I''d prefer to see the finished plate without the spices ... looks a bit too much.  Still a nice composition.  I like it.', '2003-02-03 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
