(206876, 12045, 2716, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous black background which contrasts very nicely with the eggs.  I find the way the egg is being held unnatural.  I would like to see the two hands splitting the egg, or one hand like the chefs do.  Still a neat shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Gorgeous black background which contrasts very nicely with the eggs.  I find the way the egg is being held unnatural.  I would like to see the two hands splitting the egg, or one hand like the chefs do.  Still a neat shot.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7', '2003-02-03 21:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(206877, 11756, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, questionable execution.  I would like to see alot more focus.</td>', 'Nice concept, questionable execution.  I would like to see alot more focus.', '2003-02-03 21:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(206880, 11783, 2716, '<td valign="top">I''ve quite a few afters in my time.  Cute idea to have the bar sign reflection.</td>', 'I''ve quite a few afters in my time.  Cute idea to have the bar sign reflection.', '2003-02-03 21:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(206881, 11737, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very neat concept.  How tchu do it?  is one a picture and the other one the real thing ... euh, you catch my drift.  Good job.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Very neat concept.  How tchu do it?  is one a picture and the other one the real thing ... euh, you catch my drift.  Good job.  Jacko.  9', '2003-02-03 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(206884, 12013, 4967, '<td valign="top">You fit the challenge however this is not an overly attractive photo, either compositionally or stylistically.  I really don''t care for the super dark on the right and the super light on the left, plus your light source shines brightly off the condom package.  I would have maybe cropped in more and moved the condom package closer, so that they were almost on top of each other, might make it somewhat more visually attractive.  I give you some points for meeting the challenge, and the photo is in focus... -5-</td>', 'You fit the challenge however this is not an overly attractive photo, either compositionally or stylistically.  I really don''t care for the super dark on the right and the super light on the left, plus your light source shines brightly off the condom package.  I would have maybe cropped in more and moved the condom package closer, so that they were almost on top of each other, might make it somewhat more visually attractive.  I give you some points for meeting the challenge, and the photo is in focus... -5-', '2003-02-03 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(206885, 11986, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  I like it.  The title makes the shot.  Otherwise, it would just seem too much.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'lol.  I like it.  The title makes the shot.  Otherwise, it would just seem too much.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-03 21:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(206886, 12030, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.  I didn''t now an apple with a bite in it could look soo appealing.  Good job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Very nice still life.  I didn''t now an apple with a bite in it could look soo appealing.  Good job.  Jacko.', '2003-02-03 21:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(206889, 11680, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ben? lol.  Nice interpretation of the subject.  Good luck.  jacko.</td>', 'Ben? lol.  Nice interpretation of the subject.  Good luck.  jacko.', '2003-02-03 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(206891, 12004, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  This is great.  Tiny recommendations: 1)   leave a bit more room in front of the feet (looks like the little feet have room to move)  2)  use more than one light source to reduce the shadow on the right.  Other than that, super duper shot.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  This is great.  Tiny recommendations: 1)   leave a bit more room in front of the feet (looks like the little feet have room to move)  2)  use more than one light source to reduce the shadow on the right.  Other than that, super duper shot.  Jacko.  9', '2003-02-03 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(206892, 11849, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the subject.  Good job on keepin the text parallel with the horizon.  good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the subject.  Good job on keepin the text parallel with the horizon.  good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-02-03 21:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
