(207696, 11816, 2690, '<td valign="top">I like your layout. It needs to be better light, just because you are using candles, you dont have to shoot under candle light to get the effect. a few omni lights might have helped bring out the twinkle in the glass and define the beverage better. I still gave this a 9, just needed a little more work is all. Good Job.</td>', 'I like your layout. It needs to be better light, just because you are using candles, you dont have to shoot under candle light to get the effect. a few omni lights might have helped bring out the twinkle in the glass and define the beverage better. I still gave this a 9, just needed a little more work is all. Good Job.', '2003-02-04 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
