(208280, 11889, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful piece of art. This is one of only two 10s from me in this challenge. The detail, the focus, contrast all are superb. Brilliant masking of the mans head to match the skull.  This is impressive.</td>', 'This is a powerful piece of art. This is one of only two 10s from me in this challenge. The detail, the focus, contrast all are superb. Brilliant masking of the mans head to match the skull.  This is impressive.', '2003-02-04 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(208282, 11987, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is so well done. the colors and lighting are great. The green leaf is a perfect addition to balance the shot. 10</td>', 'This is so well done. the colors and lighting are great. The green leaf is a perfect addition to balance the shot. 10', '2003-02-04 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(208285, 12004, 2079, '<td valign="top">Very nice work. I like the odd shape of the frame and the lighting shows natural colors.</td>', 'Very nice work. I like the odd shape of the frame and the lighting shows natural colors.', '2003-02-04 23:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(208348, 11889, 6403, '<td valign="top">Chilling! Great contrasts. This takes my vote for the best here so far.</td>', 'Chilling! Great contrasts. This takes my vote for the best here so far.', '2003-02-05 01:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(208513, 11796, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice photo that I think could have been better if it were sharper.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo that I think could have been better if it were sharper.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-05 07:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(208637, 12006, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met, although i really don''t think this is the delicate way ;)  this is a creative idea and technically a very sound photo.  your lighting is nice and even, and your focus spot-on.  i like it.  i also like how the egg yolk ended up right in the middle of the shot, kind of connecting the two halves.  what distracts me a little is the creased background and the slight highlights on it.  i know this is a messy thing, but instead of a plastic bag maybe a large sheet of paper or thin cardboard that you can toss afterwards would''ve been more suitable.  overall a really nice photo :)</td>', 'challenge met, although i really don''t think this is the delicate way ;)  this is a creative idea and technically a very sound photo.  your lighting is nice and even, and your focus spot-on.  i like it.  i also like how the egg yolk ended up right in the middle of the shot, kind of connecting the two halves.  what distracts me a little is the creased background and the slight highlights on it.  i know this is a messy thing, but instead of a plastic bag maybe a large sheet of paper or thin cardboard that you can toss afterwards would''ve been more suitable.  overall a really nice photo :)', '2003-02-05 11:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(208639, 11894, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  nice idea to contrast the new bridge with the old crumbled building.  i also like that the building is darker, helping to set the two apart.  of course a blue sky would be nice (even nicer if we could control the weather ;).  the one thing that i would consider doing differently that is within your control is to crop a little more off the left side to eliminate the neg space at the top left that i don''t feel adds anything to the shot.  nice shot overall :)</td>', 'challenge met.  nice idea to contrast the new bridge with the old crumbled building.  i also like that the building is darker, helping to set the two apart.  of course a blue sky would be nice (even nicer if we could control the weather ;).  the one thing that i would consider doing differently that is within your control is to crop a little more off the left side to eliminate the neg space at the top left that i don''t feel adds anything to the shot.  nice shot overall :)', '2003-02-05 12:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(208647, 11913, 6618, '<td valign="top">This one seems to show the true before and after along with being eye appealing.</td>', 'This one seems to show the true before and after along with being eye appealing.', '2003-02-05 12:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(208696, 11875, 6597, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2003-02-05 12:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208756, 12048, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like your composition a lot.  an unusual angle, plus the curved path through the beans is nice.  although, if the glass was pushed toward someone i''d be more natural for it to look straight ... but i guess it works for the photo.  i like the separation of layers in your latté, and your focus of the beans getting less sharp in the back is great.  i also like that you filled the whole backgroud with them.  basically, i really don''t have any areas for improvement.  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  i like your composition a lot.  an unusual angle, plus the curved path through the beans is nice.  although, if the glass was pushed toward someone i''d be more natural for it to look straight ... but i guess it works for the photo.  i like the separation of layers in your latté, and your focus of the beans getting less sharp in the back is great.  i also like that you filled the whole backgroud with them.  basically, i really don''t have any areas for improvement.  :)', '2003-02-05 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(208796, 12040, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  my initial reaction was to comment that there''s a streak through the picture, but i think it''s a movement trail.  i wonder whether this is really corn popping in the pot or whether you affected it somehow.  if you did the movement, maybe moving it slower might have made the streak more prominent.  good idea for the photo, and good execution, too.  i like how the corn is slowly getting out of focus towards the back.</td>', 'challenge met.  my initial reaction was to comment that there''s a streak through the picture, but i think it''s a movement trail.  i wonder whether this is really corn popping in the pot or whether you affected it somehow.  if you did the movement, maybe moving it slower might have made the streak more prominent.  good idea for the photo, and good execution, too.  i like how the corn is slowly getting out of focus towards the back.', '2003-02-05 15:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(208816, 12004, 3791, '<td valign="top">those little toes seam familiar<br/>;)</td>', 'those little toes seam familiar;)', '2003-02-05 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(208824, 11828, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little extreme.....How about fried eggs and cooked but not eaten chicken?  It looks like it will be a long time ''til the next feast!  Picture quality very good, subject matter less good.  A little dark.  (Are those soap suds under the chicken?)  Not something I''d hang on my wall, O.K?  7 Swash</td>', 'A little extreme.....How about fried eggs and cooked but not eaten chicken?  It looks like it will be a long time ''til the next feast!  Picture quality very good, subject matter less good.  A little dark.  (Are those soap suds under the chicken?)  Not something I''d hang on my wall, O.K?  7 Swash', '2003-02-05 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(208829, 12033, 714, '<td valign="top">The reason I like this shot so much is the graininess.  I like the background color agains the red rose and the dead flower.  Makes them really stand out.  I also like the framing.  Good luck.</td>', 'The reason I like this shot so much is the graininess.  I like the background color agains the red rose and the dead flower.  Makes them really stand out.  I also like the framing.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(208830, 11867, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the framing.  The colors really work here. Good luck</td>', 'I love the idea and the framing.  The colors really work here. Good luck', '2003-02-05 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(208831, 11748, 714, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome macor.  Love the different textures.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is an awesome macor.  Love the different textures.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 16:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(208832, 11880, 714, '<td valign="top">The colors and beatuiful.  This would make a great ad.  Good luck.</td>', 'The colors and beatuiful.  This would make a great ad.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(208833, 12004, 714, '<td valign="top">Now those are some short little legs.  Very cute shot.  Did you try this in b/w.  Might look good.  great lighting and I like the framing.  Good luck.</td>', 'Now those are some short little legs.  Very cute shot.  Did you try this in b/w.  Might look good.  great lighting and I like the framing.  Good luck.', '2003-02-05 16:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(208838, 12042, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done shot.  (A little too much yellow, maybe a black background?)  Ohhh, the corn tortillas are eating the corn on the cob (I finally got the title!!)  At first, I thought of serial killers, less than nice subject, but now I get it, it''s much better!  The silk doesn''t show up well either (more background issue).   8 Swash</td>', 'Very well done shot.  (A little too much yellow, maybe a black background?)  Ohhh, the corn tortillas are eating the corn on the cob (I finally got the title!!)  At first, I thought of serial killers, less than nice subject, but now I get it, it''s much better!  The silk doesn''t show up well either (more background issue).   8 Swash', '2003-02-05 16:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(208864, 11794, 5070, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful shot ... thank you for sharing.</td>', 'This is a powerful shot ... thank you for sharing.', '2003-02-05 17:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(209029, 11748, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail and contrast in colors that make this interesting to look at.</td>', 'I really like the detail and contrast in colors that make this interesting to look at.', '2003-02-05 19:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(209034, 11745, 4430, '<td valign="top">nice dof, nice bright colors, like the white bg. well done.</td>', 'nice dof, nice bright colors, like the white bg. well done.', '2003-02-05 19:11:49.000000', NULL, 1);
