(209453, 12004, 1856, '<td valign="top">Adorable!!  Great idea and composition.  The lighting is good but may be improved if the shadows on the right were lightened a bit.  Though it would probably look more b &amp; a if the adult feet/legs were unclothed...I like it better this way. The contrast makes those chubby little legs and feet stand out more.  Love it! 9 Lisa</td>', 'Adorable!!  Great idea and composition.  The lighting is good but may be improved if the shadows on the right were lightened a bit.  Though it would probably look more b & a if the adult feet/legs were unclothed...I like it better this way. The contrast makes those chubby little legs and feet stand out more.  Love it! 9 Lisa', '2003-02-06 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
