(210565, 12030, 2700, '<td valign="top">you need to light from the front as well as the side... still life shouln''t have shadows that are under or to the side IMHO... one easy thing would be to use the flash...</td>', 'you need to light from the front as well as the side... still life shouln''t have shadows that are under or to the side IMHO... one easy thing would be to use the flash...', '2003-02-08 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210567, 11737, 2700, '<td valign="top">don''t know how you did this.... get an admin note this looks like 2 VERY different pictures... you can tell by the brigtness of the left matchbox, and the right matchbox, also the light source seems to come from "behind" the left candel, but it seeams the ONLY light source in the right is the candle because of the shadow on the matchbox, even though it is EXACTLY in the same position as the candle in the left image.....</td>', 'don''t know how you did this.... get an admin note this looks like 2 VERY different pictures... you can tell by the brigtness of the left matchbox, and the right matchbox, also the light source seems to come from "behind" the left candel, but it seeams the ONLY light source in the right is the candle because of the shadow on the matchbox, even though it is EXACTLY in the same position as the candle in the left image.....', '2003-02-08 01:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(210569, 11999, 2700, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, I dont know why though....</td>', 'I like this a lot, I dont know why though....', '2003-02-08 02:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(210586, 12015, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Good composition, background and focus. The colours are perfect. Your choice of white and black border is right. But I would have preferred the black border outside the white a little thinner. The lighting angles are perfect but a little more diffuse light from right would have made good shadows but not so dominating in the right rose. But ... overall a very good job and I like the shot very much. High score from Sweden. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea. Good composition, background and focus. The colours are perfect. Your choice of white and black border is right. But I would have preferred the black border outside the white a little thinner. The lighting angles are perfect but a little more diffuse light from right would have made good shadows but not so dominating in the right rose. But ... overall a very good job and I like the shot very much. High score from Sweden. Good luck.', '2003-02-08 03:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(210587, 11926, 5834, '<td valign="top">Great picture the only think i sould do is to put the candle on the left side of the picture!</td>', 'Great picture the only think i sould do is to put the candle on the left side of the picture!', '2003-02-08 04:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(210588, 11748, 5834, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, nice contrast. I think this is one of teh best pics of this week!</td>', 'Nice focus, nice contrast. I think this is one of teh best pics of this week!', '2003-02-08 04:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(210649, 12006, 2110, '<td valign="top">ice thought!!  I feel the shape of the yellow is truely depicting the delicate extraction, and is in contrast with the hammer action. Was the title an after thought or it was planned like that right from the beginning??</td>', 'ice thought!!  I feel the shape of the yellow is truely depicting the delicate extraction, and is in contrast with the hammer action. Was the title an after thought or it was planned like that right from the beginning??', '2003-02-08 07:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(210655, 12045, 1037, '<td valign="top">The photo is very nicely lit and exposed and the composition is effective. Looks like you used noise removal? The skin on the hand looks kind of odd. On theme and well photographed, but not a photo that grabs me.</td>', 'The photo is very nicely lit and exposed and the composition is effective. Looks like you used noise removal? The skin on the hand looks kind of odd. On theme and well photographed, but not a photo that grabs me.', '2003-02-08 09:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210656, 11934, 1037, '<td valign="top">The connection to the challenge is absent without the title. The photo is an interesting candid shot of some guys making fools of themselves, with effective composition. I''m sure a lot of people will call it a "snapshot", but I would disagree. I don''t know that I like it overly much though.</td>', 'The connection to the challenge is absent without the title. The photo is an interesting candid shot of some guys making fools of themselves, with effective composition. I''m sure a lot of people will call it a "snapshot", but I would disagree. I don''t know that I like it overly much though.', '2003-02-08 09:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(210658, 11900, 1037, '<td valign="top">You''re Australian too! I can tell :).<br/> <br/>This is colourful and on theme, but I think you should study composition a little more. It doesn''t seem tight to me. The lines are a bit awkward, and the sloping ticket pulls the eyes out of the photo. The coins stablilise the composition a little, but not enough to make it pleasing to me. It''s also a flat photo, taken from an angle directly above. There is no depth. Try some from a lower angle, and if you have control over aperture, use a wide one to get some shallow DOF. This helps with macro setups like this to tighten the composition and draw the viewer''s eyes right to where your focus is.</td>', 'You''re Australian too! I can tell :). This is colourful and on theme, but I think you should study composition a little more. It doesn''t seem tight to me. The lines are a bit awkward, and the sloping ticket pulls the eyes out of the photo. The coins stablilise the composition a little, but not enough to make it pleasing to me. It''s also a flat photo, taken from an angle directly above. There is no depth. Try some from a lower angle, and if you have control over aperture, use a wide one to get some shallow DOF. This helps with macro setups like this to tighten the composition and draw the viewer''s eyes right to where your focus is.', '2003-02-08 09:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(210659, 11849, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. Very well conceived and photographed. You obviously put a lot of time into it, and it paid off. I think this photo is perfect. 10!</td>', 'This is gorgeous. Very well conceived and photographed. You obviously put a lot of time into it, and it paid off. I think this photo is perfect. 10!', '2003-02-08 09:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(210660, 12033, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the grain and dramatic shadows. There''s something really foreboding about this photo that makes me feel as though it''s metaphorical. We''re talking about universal fear of ageing and death here! Very creative.</td>', 'I love the grain and dramatic shadows. There''s something really foreboding about this photo that makes me feel as though it''s metaphorical. We''re talking about universal fear of ageing and death here! Very creative.', '2003-02-08 09:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(210661, 11793, 1037, '<td valign="top">I respect your sentiments, but this looks like a photo of a kid''s school project... not wanting to sound harsh. The composition is a bit chaotic, and the only thing that makes it seem like it isn''t a photo of a work of art in its entirety (something that isn''t allowed in the rules) is the camera angle.</td>', 'I respect your sentiments, but this looks like a photo of a kid''s school project... not wanting to sound harsh. The composition is a bit chaotic, and the only thing that makes it seem like it isn''t a photo of a work of art in its entirety (something that isn''t allowed in the rules) is the camera angle.', '2003-02-08 09:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210662, 11889, 1863, '<td valign="top">My favourite. 10 -Annida</td>', 'My favourite. 10 -Annida', '2003-02-08 09:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(210663, 11796, 1863, '<td valign="top">I can''t place why, but this photo looks straaaaaaaaaaaangely familiar. I like the fact that you can see the pin very clearly, I mean the details are great(!) and I love the graphic thingy on the left, and the base drawing. It all looks superb, bravo.</td>', 'I can''t place why, but this photo looks straaaaaaaaaaaangely familiar. I like the fact that you can see the pin very clearly, I mean the details are great(!) and I love the graphic thingy on the left, and the base drawing. It all looks superb, bravo.', '2003-02-08 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(210664, 12042, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little pale and washed out on my monitor (which is calibrated for graphics work). Some more contrast would be good. The composition is OK. I''m not sure that your shallow DOF, blurring the foreground kernels, is really necessary for this photo.</td>', 'This photo seems a little pale and washed out on my monitor (which is calibrated for graphics work). Some more contrast would be good. The composition is OK. I''m not sure that your shallow DOF, blurring the foreground kernels, is really necessary for this photo.', '2003-02-08 09:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(210666, 11982, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gawd... the time we women are encouraged to spend rubbing goo into our skin because "we''re worth it".... I think I''m worth a yacht cruise myself :P.<br/> <br/>The composition of this is great, and that image in the background is striking. It doesn''t appeal to me though. It feels like something from a women''s magazine, and I react against that kind of self-esteem manipulating, fraudulent cosmetics-selling drivel. I blame my mother for raising me as a feminist :P.</td>', 'Gawd... the time we women are encouraged to spend rubbing goo into our skin because "we''re worth it".... I think I''m worth a yacht cruise myself :P. The composition of this is great, and that image in the background is striking. It doesn''t appeal to me though. It feels like something from a women''s magazine, and I react against that kind of self-esteem manipulating, fraudulent cosmetics-selling drivel. I blame my mother for raising me as a feminist :P.', '2003-02-08 09:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(210667, 11816, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this. Those candles have lovely halo effects around them. However, the photo doesn''t quite work for me. I think it''s the composition, mostly. The little candle at the side draws too much attention away from the other objects. Apart from it, the lines are an L shape, which feels a bit blocky.</td>', 'I love the lighting in this. Those candles have lovely halo effects around them. However, the photo doesn''t quite work for me. I think it''s the composition, mostly. The little candle at the side draws too much attention away from the other objects. Apart from it, the lines are an L shape, which feels a bit blocky.', '2003-02-08 09:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(210668, 11913, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I can''t fault it. I especially love the blue theme, a colour that shows off the smoke so beautifully and compliments the carbon on the burnt match. Perfect composition. 10 from me.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I can''t fault it. I especially love the blue theme, a colour that shows off the smoke so beautifully and compliments the carbon on the burnt match. Perfect composition. 10 from me.', '2003-02-08 09:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210671, 11867, 1037, '<td valign="top">As a vegetarian.... naah, I shouldn''t bring politics into it :). I love the creative compsition on this, the border, and the darkness of your sense of humour. That pig is so cuddly :(.</td>', 'As a vegetarian.... naah, I shouldn''t bring politics into it :). I love the creative compsition on this, the border, and the darkness of your sense of humour. That pig is so cuddly :(.', '2003-02-08 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210681, 11875, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see the point of the rose. It doesn''t look like a real flower, either, it looks like fabric. The baby''s breath is lovely, with that shallow DOF effect turning it into a pretty white cloud. I think you could have taken a great photo without the rose.</td>', 'I don''t quite see the point of the rose. It doesn''t look like a real flower, either, it looks like fabric. The baby''s breath is lovely, with that shallow DOF effect turning it into a pretty white cloud. I think you could have taken a great photo without the rose.', '2003-02-08 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(210682, 11974, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is effective with the title. Without it, the connection to the challenge is loose. I think it passes though :). Spectacular sunset, which I''m sure you''re getting a great response to. I like the framing of the playground.</td>', 'This photo is effective with the title. Without it, the connection to the challenge is loose. I think it passes though :). Spectacular sunset, which I''m sure you''re getting a great response to. I like the framing of the playground.', '2003-02-08 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210684, 11719, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very subtle. The wood pile is a bit difficult to interpret because of the tight cropping. I love the colours in this, but it feels crowded and awkward, and that shadow on the bottom log doesn''t help the composition. It leads the eye to the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'Very subtle. The wood pile is a bit difficult to interpret because of the tight cropping. I love the colours in this, but it feels crowded and awkward, and that shadow on the bottom log doesn''t help the composition. It leads the eye to the bottom of the photo.', '2003-02-08 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210685, 11693, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the connection to the challenge. I don''t see a visual juxtaposition of an unpruned tree next to a pruned one.  The composition is busy and confusing, and the colours are a bit washed out.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the connection to the challenge. I don''t see a visual juxtaposition of an unpruned tree next to a pruned one.  The composition is busy and confusing, and the colours are a bit washed out.', '2003-02-08 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(210687, 11864, 1037, '<td valign="top">Effective DOF, bringing the focus right to the tip of the pencil. The composition is strong. I like the textures ofthe wood shavings, etc. Thematically, it''s on theme, but it doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Effective DOF, bringing the focus right to the tip of the pencil. The composition is strong. I like the textures ofthe wood shavings, etc. Thematically, it''s on theme, but it doesn''t grab me.', '2003-02-08 10:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(210688, 12012, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a bit flat. You lit these coins really nicely to show the designs on them beautifully, but I don''t respond well to photos that seem to be very two dimensional.</td>', 'Nice, but a bit flat. You lit these coins really nicely to show the designs on them beautifully, but I don''t respond well to photos that seem to be very two dimensional.', '2003-02-08 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210690, 12043, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this! The crispness of the paper is gorgeous, and origami is something I enjoy a lot. It seems a little too grey, though. A little bit longer exposure would be more to my taste. Composition is perfect.</td>', 'I love this! The crispness of the paper is gorgeous, and origami is something I enjoy a lot. It seems a little too grey, though. A little bit longer exposure would be more to my taste. Composition is perfect.', '2003-02-08 10:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210691, 12040, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think the light is a little too harsh. There are hot spots on the corn kernels and dark shadows. Also, the composition is a bit loose.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think the light is a little too harsh. There are hot spots on the corn kernels and dark shadows. Also, the composition is a bit loose.', '2003-02-08 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(210693, 11777, 1037, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a low end camera, but I used to, so I sympathise. I think this photo would be a lot stronger if you worked on the tonal depth in some image processing software. The composition is OK. It''s hard to photograph a tall building effectively. There are many examples to look at on this site. I think you could have cropped out the dark spot in the top right corner without losing anything.</td>', 'You seem to have a low end camera, but I used to, so I sympathise. I think this photo would be a lot stronger if you worked on the tonal depth in some image processing software. The composition is OK. It''s hard to photograph a tall building effectively. There are many examples to look at on this site. I think you could have cropped out the dark spot in the top right corner without losing anything.', '2003-02-08 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210695, 11680, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I love the rich black and white tones. However, I''m not sure if your dramatic lighting and composition really suit the subject matter. In another context, this would have been really cool, but just to show the effect of a growth spurt... it seems like you''re subverting your theme for humorous purposes, but it doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'This is nice. I love the rich black and white tones. However, I''m not sure if your dramatic lighting and composition really suit the subject matter. In another context, this would have been really cool, but just to show the effect of a growth spurt... it seems like you''re subverting your theme for humorous purposes, but it doesn''t quite work.', '2003-02-08 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(210696, 11756, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems like you shook the camera a little. I don''t think it''s a particularly bad effect, because battery hens are usually pretty active, and it emphasises that. The exposure is good and the composition is strong, so I think all in all it''s an OK photo :).</td>', 'Seems like you shook the camera a little. I don''t think it''s a particularly bad effect, because battery hens are usually pretty active, and it emphasises that. The exposure is good and the composition is strong, so I think all in all it''s an OK photo :).', '2003-02-08 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(210697, 11743, 1037, '<td valign="top">Strange border, thick on 2 sides and thin on 2 sides. The composition is decent, but there are odd effects in the background. The lighting is a little harsh. More diffusion (with paper or cloth over the light) would help get rid of that hotspot on the orange.</td>', 'Strange border, thick on 2 sides and thin on 2 sides. The composition is decent, but there are odd effects in the background. The lighting is a little harsh. More diffusion (with paper or cloth over the light) would help get rid of that hotspot on the orange.', '2003-02-08 10:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(210700, 11794, 1037, '<td valign="top">Looks Australian! This photo makes me really sad. I think it''s a little busy though, and the colours seem a bit odd. That sky almost seems too blue.</td>', 'Looks Australian! This photo makes me really sad. I think it''s a little busy though, and the colours seem a bit odd. That sky almost seems too blue.', '2003-02-08 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(210702, 11889, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love it! Momento Mori at its most gritty. I''m a bit indecisive about the way both "heads" are cut off at a slant at the top. It seems like both are wearing berets or something! It''s kind of distracting, but maybe in a good way? Love the lighting and deep black tones. The skull glows out of the darkness.</td>', 'I love it! Momento Mori at its most gritty. I''m a bit indecisive about the way both "heads" are cut off at a slant at the top. It seems like both are wearing berets or something! It''s kind of distracting, but maybe in a good way? Love the lighting and deep black tones. The skull glows out of the darkness.', '2003-02-08 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(210746, 12014, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think the lighting is a bit harsh. The colours are really bright and bold, but the shiny spots and dark shadow make them seem a bit overpowering.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think the lighting is a bit harsh. The colours are really bright and bold, but the shiny spots and dark shadow make them seem a bit overpowering.', '2003-02-08 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210747, 11779, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the kitchen paper works as a prop. It undermines the texture of the bread a bit. I think I would actually prefer the toast to be the top piece, because the plain piece of bread isn''t as interesting to look at.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the kitchen paper works as a prop. It undermines the texture of the bread a bit. I think I would actually prefer the toast to be the top piece, because the plain piece of bread isn''t as interesting to look at.', '2003-02-08 12:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(210748, 11987, 1037, '<td valign="top">Luscious and tangy. I think this photo strikes the right balance. It''s loaded with content and things to look at, but the composition ties it together, particularly with that bright pink circle of grapefruit flesh and green leaf. Nicely done.</td>', 'Luscious and tangy. I think this photo strikes the right balance. It''s loaded with content and things to look at, but the composition ties it together, particularly with that bright pink circle of grapefruit flesh and green leaf. Nicely done.', '2003-02-08 12:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(210753, 11928, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the ring of beans, it looks nice against the white background. Unfortunately, the side of the coffee mug is indistinct from the background on the left side, which is kind of distracting. Also, the coffee itself, in the mug, has an odd tint to it... but from my time in the US I associate weak coffee with Starbucks, so I guess that might be why :P.</td>', 'I like the ring of beans, it looks nice against the white background. Unfortunately, the side of the coffee mug is indistinct from the background on the left side, which is kind of distracting. Also, the coffee itself, in the mug, has an odd tint to it... but from my time in the US I associate weak coffee with Starbucks, so I guess that might be why :P.', '2003-02-08 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(210755, 12037, 1037, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty. I''m sure a lot of people don''t like your background, but I like it. The gradient is pleasant, and shows off the fluffiness of the popped piece of pop corn against the dark blue, while the kernel looks nice on white. The shadows are a little strong though.</td>', 'Simple and pretty. I''m sure a lot of people don''t like your background, but I like it. The gradient is pleasant, and shows off the fluffiness of the popped piece of pop corn against the dark blue, while the kernel looks nice on white. The shadows are a little strong though.', '2003-02-08 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(210757, 11904, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting.... I guess the reflected building shows the way a business starts out small and grows over time to become the big, shiny building. Very subtle and well composed. I like the grainy black and white. This is kind of a philosophical, thoughtful photo.</td>', 'Interesting.... I guess the reflected building shows the way a business starts out small and grows over time to become the big, shiny building. Very subtle and well composed. I like the grainy black and white. This is kind of a philosophical, thoughtful photo.', '2003-02-08 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(210759, 11920, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! I love the way you use shallow DOF. The flower that lost its petals is the subject, and the flower in the background is kind of a visual echo of what it used to be. I like how they nearly line up, making the effect more pronounced. I''m giving this 10.</td>', 'Cool! I love the way you use shallow DOF. The flower that lost its petals is the subject, and the flower in the background is kind of a visual echo of what it used to be. I like how they nearly line up, making the effect more pronounced. I''m giving this 10.', '2003-02-08 12:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(210761, 11748, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is a bit too hard, and the background is a dull colour. It sucks when there are more than one photo of the same thing in a challenge, because we shouldn''t score one photo relative to another, but I think "King Flame''s Court" shows really well how differently you could have shot this!</td>', 'The lighting on this is a bit too hard, and the background is a dull colour. It sucks when there are more than one photo of the same thing in a challenge, because we shouldn''t score one photo relative to another, but I think "King Flame''s Court" shows really well how differently you could have shot this!', '2003-02-08 12:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(210762, 11765, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the juxtaposition of extreme order against extreme disorder. It''s composed about as well as I think it could be, and the lighting and DOF are great.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the juxtaposition of extreme order against extreme disorder. It''s composed about as well as I think it could be, and the lighting and DOF are great.', '2003-02-08 12:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(210764, 12030, 1037, '<td valign="top">A very rich photo, nicely lit and composed. It doesn''t grab me, but I can appreciate its technical merit. I can''t fault it in that respect.</td>', 'A very rich photo, nicely lit and composed. It doesn''t grab me, but I can appreciate its technical merit. I can''t fault it in that respect.', '2003-02-08 12:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(210765, 11841, 1037, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT! It''s so cool. The very subtle, overexposed  look of the skin allows the eyelashes to take their place as the subject of the photo. The reflections in the eyes are big and bold, creating a sense of space on the other side of the camera that I like. I''m giving this 10.</td>', 'I LOVE IT! It''s so cool. The very subtle, overexposed  look of the skin allows the eyelashes to take their place as the subject of the photo. The reflections in the eyes are big and bold, creating a sense of space on the other side of the camera that I like. I''m giving this 10.', '2003-02-08 12:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210767, 12013, 1037, '<td valign="top">Crude... you could have made a much better photo out of an idea like this :P. Try a white background next time.</td>', 'Crude... you could have made a much better photo out of an idea like this :P. Try a white background next time.', '2003-02-08 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(210768, 11894, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The composition of this is really effective. The buildings down below may seem a little bit dimly lit, but that actually works given the theme of the new structure towering over the ruins of the old one.</td>', 'Beautiful. The composition of this is really effective. The buildings down below may seem a little bit dimly lit, but that actually works given the theme of the new structure towering over the ruins of the old one.', '2003-02-08 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210772, 12023, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very busy and confusing. I think you needed to pare down the number of elements you wanted to get into this photo. The impact is just not there when there are so many things to look at, and the composition doesn''t really make any one object the subject.</td>', 'Very busy and confusing. I think you needed to pare down the number of elements you wanted to get into this photo. The impact is just not there when there are so many things to look at, and the composition doesn''t really make any one object the subject.', '2003-02-08 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(210773, 12004, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, beautifully executed. That baby''s skin just glows! The composition is masterful, especially the way the baby''s feet are not in line with the adult''s. If they were, all the life would be leeched out of the photo. As they are, the subtle difference makes it live. I have to give it 10.</td>', 'Nice idea, beautifully executed. That baby''s skin just glows! The composition is masterful, especially the way the baby''s feet are not in line with the adult''s. If they were, all the life would be leeched out of the photo. As they are, the subtle difference makes it live. I have to give it 10.', '2003-02-08 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(210776, 11918, 1037, '<td valign="top">The diamond is actually quite difficult to see from this angle. Other than that, it''s a cool idea and well photographed.</td>', 'The diamond is actually quite difficult to see from this angle. Other than that, it''s a cool idea and well photographed.', '2003-02-08 12:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210850, 12037, 2279, '<td valign="top">I think the focus if off a bit but the colors and lighting are beautiful.</td>', 'I think the focus if off a bit but the colors and lighting are beautiful.', '2003-02-08 15:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(210889, 11849, 4648, '<td valign="top">This really should be #1.  Who would have ever thought this up.  So simple, so met the challenge, so good DOF (if you really want to call it that), so good composition, this is really neat.  I like it.  Sorry I can''t be of any help with a good helpful comment.  What can you say about a 10.</td>', 'This really should be #1.  Who would have ever thought this up.  So simple, so met the challenge, so good DOF (if you really want to call it that), so good composition, this is really neat.  I like it.  Sorry I can''t be of any help with a good helpful comment.  What can you say about a 10.', '2003-02-08 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(210892, 12045, 4648, '<td valign="top">Everything is right on except for the shdow, but I know you''ve already read that a lot.  I really do like it though</td>', 'Everything is right on except for the shdow, but I know you''ve already read that a lot.  I really do like it though', '2003-02-08 19:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(210893, 11779, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t you think that toast is a little over done.  I would have scraped it before buttering it.  In my opinion, if you were going to use the paper towel as the background that is all that should have been in the background.  You should have cropped it as close on the other three sides as the bottom is.  The cropping is ok if you had not used the paper towel and just put the toast on the white counter.  Either way, not both.  Other than that it is a reall good photo and right on for the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t you think that toast is a little over done.  I would have scraped it before buttering it.  In my opinion, if you were going to use the paper towel as the background that is all that should have been in the background.  You should have cropped it as close on the other three sides as the bottom is.  The cropping is ok if you had not used the paper towel and just put the toast on the white counter.  Either way, not both.  Other than that it is a reall good photo and right on for the challenge.', '2003-02-08 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210907, 11974, 2373, '<td valign="top">I think this is a most excellent photo, but {and i hate it when people say this to, and i do not mean to offend you} It doesnt seem to be before and after, just after. 8 otherwise it would be a ten. Kevin</td>', 'I think this is a most excellent photo, but {and i hate it when people say this to, and i do not mean to offend you} It doesnt seem to be before and after, just after. 8 otherwise it would be a ten. Kevin', '2003-02-08 20:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(210908, 11783, 2373, '<td valign="top">I like this alot, mine was similar but you took a different angle on it. I do wish that the image were more clear and crisp. Maybe it was the jpeg compression,  for example where the empty glass meets the table, its blury or somthing.   Also its a bit distracting were the white background meets the black. Just a thought.</td>', 'I like this alot, mine was similar but you took a different angle on it. I do wish that the image were more clear and crisp. Maybe it was the jpeg compression,  for example where the empty glass meets the table, its blury or somthing.   Also its a bit distracting were the white background meets the black. Just a thought.', '2003-02-08 20:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(210909, 11841, 2373, '<td valign="top">I like this alot, I do think that the whole image is a little overexposed,{to bright}. It could just be the difference between my monitor and yours. 7 Kevin</td>', 'I like this alot, I do think that the whole image is a little overexposed,{to bright}. It could just be the difference between my monitor and yours. 7 Kevin', '2003-02-08 20:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210910, 12037, 2373, '<td valign="top">I really like the gradient effect of the background, it brings the picture together.</td>', 'I really like the gradient effect of the background, it brings the picture together.', '2003-02-08 20:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(210912, 11875, 2373, '<td valign="top">really nice, the only thing is that the white background {it looks like stirophome or somthing} is a bit distracting. I really like red roses against a black background. 9 Kevin</td>', 'really nice, the only thing is that the white background {it looks like stirophome or somthing} is a bit distracting. I really like red roses against a black background. 9 Kevin', '2003-02-08 20:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(210916, 11777, 2373, '<td valign="top">I cant tell what you where focusing on. It may be the jpeg compression. i like your idea here and would score higher if it were more crisp and clear. 6 Kevin</td>', 'I cant tell what you where focusing on. It may be the jpeg compression. i like your idea here and would score higher if it were more crisp and clear. 6 Kevin', '2003-02-08 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(210920, 12000, 2373, '<td valign="top">Blue!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Blue!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-02-08 21:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(210926, 11737, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to hearing how you pulled this one off!  A 10 from me!</td>', 'Looking forward to hearing how you pulled this one off!  A 10 from me!', '2003-02-08 22:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(210931, 11828, 1031, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not as appetizing as a nice stack of wings ready to eat, but does take the "after" component further along its course towards heartburn and eventually coronary artery disease...</td>', 'Perhaps not as appetizing as a nice stack of wings ready to eat, but does take the "after" component further along its course towards heartburn and eventually coronary artery disease...', '2003-02-08 22:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(210934, 11934, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least of them seem to be protected by an adequate layer of adipose tissue...after all, it works for walruses...</td>', 'At least of them seem to be protected by an adequate layer of adipose tissue...after all, it works for walruses...', '2003-02-08 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(210937, 11796, 1031, '<td valign="top">It came out well! Are they expensive?</td>', 'It came out well! Are they expensive?', '2003-02-08 22:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210941, 12011, 1031, '<td valign="top">Don''t think you needed the equipment in the back. Make it completely tech by removing the beans. I think by trying to show both versions of the progression at once you dilute some of the impact unnecessarily. I like the idea and exposure; might be worth trying it again (or trying a different frame if you have alternates).</td>', 'Don''t think you needed the equipment in the back. Make it completely tech by removing the beans. I think by trying to show both versions of the progression at once you dilute some of the impact unnecessarily. I like the idea and exposure; might be worth trying it again (or trying a different frame if you have alternates).', '2003-02-08 22:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(210945, 11813, 6325, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors</td>', 'Stunning colors', '2003-02-08 23:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(210946, 11880, 6325, '<td valign="top">I''m hungry.</td>', 'I''m hungry.', '2003-02-08 23:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(210947, 12030, 6325, '<td valign="top">Really big bite. Lighting is uneven.</td>', 'Really big bite. Lighting is uneven.', '2003-02-08 23:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(210952, 11745, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hope you do better than when I tried a similar subject...you ARE more directly related to the challenge here!</td>', 'Hope you do better than when I tried a similar subject...you ARE more directly related to the challenge here!', '2003-02-08 23:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(210997, 11970, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  I see your message in your photograph.  An excellent image that deserves a placing.  Well done.  10 :)</td>', 'Excellent composition.  I see your message in your photograph.  An excellent image that deserves a placing.  Well done.  10 :)', '2003-02-09 03:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(210998, 11849, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea of a before and after shot.  I love how you have used the glasses to create the clarity.  It is a very real photo.  Well done.  GL.</td>', 'Excellent idea of a before and after shot.  I love how you have used the glasses to create the clarity.  It is a very real photo.  Well done.  GL.', '2003-02-09 03:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(210999, 11748, 1829, '<td valign="top">WOW what a macro shot.  Excellent before and after photo.  I love it.  GL.</td>', 'WOW what a macro shot.  Excellent before and after photo.  I love it.  GL.', '2003-02-09 03:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(211011, 11737, 6689, '<td valign="top">like the composition. the concept is very clear. great work!</td>', 'like the composition. the concept is very clear. great work!', '2003-02-09 07:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(211036, 11765, 6669, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting to show texture, the mat works well with the composition. <br/>my only critsism is the join in the background, which I find a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting to show texture, the mat works well with the composition. my only critsism is the join in the background, which I find a little distracting.', '2003-02-09 09:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(211037, 11748, 6669, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot! Simple subject, simple lighting, simple background and it worksfor me! very pleasing picture.</td>', 'I like this a lot! Simple subject, simple lighting, simple background and it worksfor me! very pleasing picture.', '2003-02-09 09:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(211038, 12011, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo effectively shows the process of making coffee, but I think there is too much in it to have a high impact. It''s more of a diagram, something that could illustrate a page in a book on coffee making or something. It''s well photographed, but not appealing.</td>', 'This photo effectively shows the process of making coffee, but I think there is too much in it to have a high impact. It''s more of a diagram, something that could illustrate a page in a book on coffee making or something. It''s well photographed, but not appealing.', '2003-02-09 09:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(211039, 11970, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this. It''s very creative. It gives a strong impression of the experience of being drunk, before and after, putting the viewer in that frame of mind rather than just illustrating a concept.</td>', 'I like this. It''s very creative. It gives a strong impression of the experience of being drunk, before and after, putting the viewer in that frame of mind rather than just illustrating a concept.', '2003-02-09 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(211040, 12048, 1037, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit cheesy, but I love the composition and camera angle here. The swirl in the beans is gorgeous. The lighting is very warm, somehow it really conjures the smell of coffee to me. The only thing I don''t like is that it''s yet another bloody Starbucks reference... why is that brand name so common on this site? I''m glad we''ve managed to escape Starbuckisation in my country so far!</td>', 'The title is a bit cheesy, but I love the composition and camera angle here. The swirl in the beans is gorgeous. The lighting is very warm, somehow it really conjures the smell of coffee to me. The only thing I don''t like is that it''s yet another bloody Starbucks reference... why is that brand name so common on this site? I''m glad we''ve managed to escape Starbuckisation in my country so far!', '2003-02-09 09:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(211041, 12006, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I don''t think it makes a nice photo. The composition just doesn''t work for me. The hammers lead my eyes out to the sides of the photo. I think a bit more asymmetry would have helped.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I don''t think it makes a nice photo. The composition just doesn''t work for me. The hammers lead my eyes out to the sides of the photo. I think a bit more asymmetry would have helped.', '2003-02-09 09:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(211042, 11926, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. It''s a bit cluttered with imagery though. If you could have copied this page and cut out some of the other diagrams, it could have made a clearer photo.</td>', 'Interesting idea. It''s a bit cluttered with imagery though. If you could have copied this page and cut out some of the other diagrams, it could have made a clearer photo.', '2003-02-09 09:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(211043, 12000, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this photo for being full of character. The composition is a little confusing because of the compeition between the girl''s eyes and the photo for attention. But overall, I like it.</td>', 'I like this photo for being full of character. The composition is a little confusing because of the compeition between the girl''s eyes and the photo for attention. But overall, I like it.', '2003-02-09 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(211044, 11848, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool idea... but the lighting is far too stark and the photo has little tonal depth. It needs more contrast, but if you do that, the jacket on the right will be indistinguishable from the background. I think you should have used a white background or maybe grey, and not used front lighting (is it the flash?).</td>', 'Cool idea... but the lighting is far too stark and the photo has little tonal depth. It needs more contrast, but if you do that, the jacket on the right will be indistinguishable from the background. I think you should have used a white background or maybe grey, and not used front lighting (is it the flash?).', '2003-02-09 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(211045, 11893, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is a little dull. A closer crop could have been better. A lot of the glass is in shadow, which makes it hard to distinguish from the dark background. Some more lighting from the left or front could have helped.</td>', 'The composition of this is a little dull. A closer crop could have been better. A lot of the glass is in shadow, which makes it hard to distinguish from the dark background. Some more lighting from the left or front could have helped.', '2003-02-09 09:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(211046, 12035, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely tight shot. The composition of this is great, I love how all the bananas kind of spiral out from one point. The lighting is nice, and I love the bright yellow colours.</td>', 'Lovely tight shot. The composition of this is great, I love how all the bananas kind of spiral out from one point. The lighting is nice, and I love the bright yellow colours.', '2003-02-09 09:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(211048, 11783, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool filtering. Was it done with despeckle? It makes it seem like a watercolour illustration. The lines and colours in this are nice and bold. I really like it.</td>', 'Cool filtering. Was it done with despeckle? It makes it seem like a watercolour illustration. The lines and colours in this are nice and bold. I really like it.', '2003-02-09 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(211051, 11938, 1037, '<td valign="top">Weird.... you must have cut out that glowing "C" and lit it from behind? Overall, the photo seems dim and grey, and the composition is a bit cluttered. I don''t really find it appealing.</td>', 'Weird.... you must have cut out that glowing "C" and lit it from behind? Overall, the photo seems dim and grey, and the composition is a bit cluttered. I don''t really find it appealing.', '2003-02-09 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(211052, 11745, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very well photographed to be reminiscent of childhood. Nice and colourful, and tightly composed. The soft shadows are lovely, so is the shallow DOF. But.... it''s chewed gum! Bleh!</td>', 'This is very well photographed to be reminiscent of childhood. Nice and colourful, and tightly composed. The soft shadows are lovely, so is the shallow DOF. But.... it''s chewed gum! Bleh!', '2003-02-09 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(211053, 11828, 1037, '<td valign="top">Oh dear lord.... as a vegan, all I can say about this photo is EWW! I''m sorry, but this is too ugly for words, and it''s not even well lit or photographed. I don''t intend to be mean, but if you had put a bit more work into the technical side of it, I might have been able to overcome the fact that I''ve always felt like retching at the site of deep fried chicken.</td>', 'Oh dear lord.... as a vegan, all I can say about this photo is EWW! I''m sorry, but this is too ugly for words, and it''s not even well lit or photographed. I don''t intend to be mean, but if you had put a bit more work into the technical side of it, I might have been able to overcome the fact that I''ve always felt like retching at the site of deep fried chicken.', '2003-02-09 09:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(211055, 11813, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell what I''m looking at or how it is related to earthquakes. It''s a really cool photo... it''s just so foreign to me that I don''t know how to interpret this! Is there a faultline here that the water is washing over? <br/> <br/>I think the rocky part at the top of the photo is a bit distracting. It''s hard to tell what it is and how it''s related to the rest of the image.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell what I''m looking at or how it is related to earthquakes. It''s a really cool photo... it''s just so foreign to me that I don''t know how to interpret this! Is there a faultline here that the water is washing over?  I think the rocky part at the top of the photo is a bit distracting. It''s hard to tell what it is and how it''s related to the rest of the image.', '2003-02-09 10:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(211056, 11805, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The way you composed the glass is really attractive. I like the reflections in the mirror too.</td>', 'This is cool. The way you composed the glass is really attractive. I like the reflections in the mirror too.', '2003-02-09 10:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(211057, 11999, 1037, '<td valign="top">Yet another water droplet photo..... It''s a really good one though! I love the simplicity of it, and in this case central composition works. The plate and the table have a Japanese feel to me. I''ll have to give it 10 for being so zen!</td>', 'Yet another water droplet photo..... It''s a really good one though! I love the simplicity of it, and in this case central composition works. The plate and the table have a Japanese feel to me. I''ll have to give it 10 for being so zen!', '2003-02-09 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(211060, 11807, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best fruit photo in this challenge. The colours are lovely. The composition is a bit too busy though. Perhaps you went in just a teeny bit too tight.</td>', 'I think this is the best fruit photo in this challenge. The colours are lovely. The composition is a bit too busy though. Perhaps you went in just a teeny bit too tight.', '2003-02-09 10:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(211061, 11708, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to enjoy a photo like this when you don''t eat meat, but it''s nicely composed and has an interesting, soft focus look to it. I like the different shapes of the plate and the meat tray. The chilli (pepper, whatever) is a nice touch. Overall, though, it''s a little bit flat and washed out.</td>', 'It''s hard to enjoy a photo like this when you don''t eat meat, but it''s nicely composed and has an interesting, soft focus look to it. I like the different shapes of the plate and the meat tray. The chilli (pepper, whatever) is a nice touch. Overall, though, it''s a little bit flat and washed out.', '2003-02-09 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(211064, 11737, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! You did really well to set this up. The rotational symmetry of the piece is a little too static and formal for me, but I appreciate that technically it is a very good photo.</td>', 'Cool! You did really well to set this up. The rotational symmetry of the piece is a little too static and formal for me, but I appreciate that technically it is a very good photo.', '2003-02-09 10:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(211067, 11986, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s so pop art, but with some kind of passive-agressive thing going on :). Brilliant colours. I can imagine this in a modern art gallery. 10 from me.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s so pop art, but with some kind of passive-agressive thing going on :). Brilliant colours. I can imagine this in a modern art gallery. 10 from me.', '2003-02-09 10:15:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(211068, 11880, 1037, '<td valign="top">So colourful! This would look great in a cook book, to tempt you to try out the recipe on the opposite page. As a work of art it isn''t as interesting to me, but as an illustration it works well.</td>', 'So colourful! This would look great in a cook book, to tempt you to try out the recipe on the opposite page. As a work of art it isn''t as interesting to me, but as an illustration it works well.', '2003-02-09 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(211072, 12015, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the colours. I can''t really get over how diseased the icy rose looks... it''s not very attractive to me, but then subverting the usual imagery of a red rose isn''t exactly a bad thing :). I love the camera angle, the lighting, the dark background, and the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the colours. I can''t really get over how diseased the icy rose looks... it''s not very attractive to me, but then subverting the usual imagery of a red rose isn''t exactly a bad thing :). I love the camera angle, the lighting, the dark background, and the shallow DOF.', '2003-02-09 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(211124, 11813, 656, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The textures and curving shapes are really effective.  <br/> <br/>Not so sure about the pale blue drop shadow but a great picture (10)</td>', 'Love this.  The textures and curving shapes are really effective.   Not so sure about the pale blue drop shadow but a great picture (10)', '2003-02-09 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(211135, 11849, 368, '<td valign="top">awesome DOF ... i really like the simplicity of this image ... and certainly fits the challenge</td>', 'awesome DOF ... i really like the simplicity of this image ... and certainly fits the challenge', '2003-02-09 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(211138, 11880, 368, '<td valign="top">great composition and colors ... makes me hungry :)</td>', 'great composition and colors ... makes me hungry :)', '2003-02-09 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(211155, 11974, 4267, '<td valign="top">please help, I don''t see a before.. just an after</td>', 'please help, I don''t see a before.. just an after', '2003-02-09 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(211175, 11987, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo!<br/>It makes me feel thirsty, it makes me wanting to make a fruit drink myself. :)<br/>I like the composition, the colors are good, sharpness is ok. The green leaf makes it more interesting and complete. The glare from the fruit makes it look fresh and healthy.<br/>The only thing it could do without is the reflection on the glass, haven''t used my polarizer filter enough yet to know if that could take it away. This is my highest rated picture though. ;)</td>', 'Great photo!It makes me feel thirsty, it makes me wanting to make a fruit drink myself. :)I like the composition, the colors are good, sharpness is ok. The green leaf makes it more interesting and complete. The glare from the fruit makes it look fresh and healthy.The only thing it could do without is the reflection on the glass, haven''t used my polarizer filter enough yet to know if that could take it away. This is my highest rated picture though. ;)', '2003-02-09 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(211176, 12030, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and exposure, very clean shot.<br/>Nice healthy glare from the apples and great colors. Nice background.</td>', 'Good lighting and exposure, very clean shot.Nice healthy glare from the apples and great colors. Nice background.', '2003-02-09 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(211180, 12004, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good photo, cool subjects. :)<br/>Would be interesting to see what it looks like at a more sideways angle, could improve the composition somewhat and create a more even lighting, it is pretty strong from the right at the moment, but the baby''s leg area is well exposed.<br/>Perhaps some more room in the fron''t some space to step into, crop is tight.</td>', 'Good photo, cool subjects. :)Would be interesting to see what it looks like at a more sideways angle, could improve the composition somewhat and create a more even lighting, it is pretty strong from the right at the moment, but the baby''s leg area is well exposed.Perhaps some more room in the fron''t some space to step into, crop is tight.', '2003-02-09 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(211185, 12042, 3032, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh, good lighting. With the corn in the front a smaller aperture wouldn''t hurt though. The pattern of the glass fits the pattern of the corn. Nice.</td>', 'Made me laugh, good lighting. With the corn in the front a smaller aperture wouldn''t hurt though. The pattern of the glass fits the pattern of the corn. Nice.', '2003-02-09 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(211187, 12023, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cheers!<br/>That must taste great!<br/>Nice clean image, good lighting, could use some improvement in the composition. Perhaps the glass slightly off-center.<br/>Good depth.</td>', 'Cheers!That must taste great!Nice clean image, good lighting, could use some improvement in the composition. Perhaps the glass slightly off-center.Good depth.', '2003-02-09 14:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(211225, 11737, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done., wish I could figure it out! 10</td>', 'Very cleverly done., wish I could figure it out! 10', '2003-02-09 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(211259, 11913, 3018, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Focus is good.  I love the color tonalities on the picture.  I don''t quite like the blue border, maybe it''s better with the black one by itself.  But it doesn''t detract from the picture for me.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  Focus is good.  I love the color tonalities on the picture.  I don''t quite like the blue border, maybe it''s better with the black one by itself.  But it doesn''t detract from the picture for me.  Good luck!', '2003-02-09 17:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(211260, 11889, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Dark idea.  B&amp;W is perfect for the picture.  Borders are right on.  Focus, lighting and contrast are excellent.  One of the top pictures in the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition. Dark idea.  B&W is perfect for the picture.  Borders are right on.  Focus, lighting and contrast are excellent.  One of the top pictures in the challenge.  Good luck!', '2003-02-09 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(211262, 12037, 3018, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea!  Light is too harsh, maybe a little softer would be better.  It also needs sharper focus.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent idea!  Light is too harsh, maybe a little softer would be better.  It also needs sharper focus.  Good luck!', '2003-02-09 17:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(211266, 11867, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very funny! Nice idea.  Composition is good.  Nice border but it doesn''t look quite good because of the automatic border added by the site.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very funny! Nice idea.  Composition is good.  Nice border but it doesn''t look quite good because of the automatic border added by the site.  Good luck!', '2003-02-09 17:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
