(212243, 11849, 3032, '<td valign="top">Yeeehaaaaaa!!!!<br/>Thanks everyone!<br/> <br/>It must have been two or three weeks ago that I said in the forums and/or in the chat that I expected to make "ribbon-quality" in a year or two from now. :) <br/>Never expected this when I made it, I was just happy to score a 7+ and was anxious that it would just drop below it the whole week. I dreamed about a ribbon though. :) <br/>Didn''t wan''t to get out of bed this morning in case it would be #4 or #5, but guess what, I got third! (/me makes funny moves with arms)<br/> <br/>Thanks to all of you, it is also your photo''s that inspire &amp; help me. DPChallenge was the first site to really make me think about what I am doing with my camera and the critique club is a great help too.<br/>Guess I have to do better in the future, lets say that I wan''t to get a red ribbon within five years. ;)<br/> <br/>Get the party started, drinks are on me!</td>', 'Yeeehaaaaaa!!!!Thanks everyone! It must have been two or three weeks ago that I said in the forums and/or in the chat that I expected to make "ribbon-quality" in a year or two from now. :) Never expected this when I made it, I was just happy to score a 7+ and was anxious that it would just drop below it the whole week. I dreamed about a ribbon though. :) Didn''t wan''t to get out of bed this morning in case it would be #4 or #5, but guess what, I got third! (/me makes funny moves with arms) Thanks to all of you, it is also your photo''s that inspire & help me. DPChallenge was the first site to really make me think about what I am doing with my camera and the critique club is a great help too.Guess I have to do better in the future, lets say that I wan''t to get a red ribbon within five years. ;) Get the party started, drinks are on me!', '2003-02-10 13:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
